# Apple Website Clone 🍎

A front-end clone of Apple's website that I built while learning HTML and CSS.

## What I Practiced

* HTML structure and semantic sections
* CSS layouts and positioning
* Flexbox and CSS Grid
* Styling buttons, navigation, and product sections
* Using images and video in a webpage
* Basic JavaScript for handling links

## Features

* Apple-style navigation bar
* Hero section with video
* Product sections and cards
* Footnotes section
* Apple-style footer
* Clone notice

## Built With

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

## Note

This is a practice project created for learning purposes. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple.
